<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Code de vérification 2FA - AgriLink</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f1f5f1;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#f1f5f1;">
        <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:40px 16px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" style="max-width:600px;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">

                    {# Logo Header #}
                    <tr>
                        <td style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:28px 40px 20px;text-align:center;border-bottom:3px solid #16a34a;">
                            <img src="{{ appUrl }}/logo_with_text.png" alt="AgriLink" style="height:56px;width:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;" />
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    {# Icon Banner #}
                    <tr>
                        <td style="background-color:#166534;padding:24px 40px;text-align:center;">
                            <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);border-radius:50%;width:52px;height:52px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;">
                                        <svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;margin-top:12px;">
                                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/>
                                        </svg>
                                    </td>
                                    <td style="padding-left:14px;text-align:left;">
                                        <p style="margin:0;color:#ffffff;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.01em;">Vérification en deux étapes</p>
                                        <p style="margin:4px 0 0;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);font-size:13px;">Confirmez votre identité pour accéder à votre compte</p>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    {# Body #}
                    <tr>
                        <td style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:36px 40px;">
                            <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px;color:#374151;">Bonjour <strong>{{ user.prenom ?? user.email }}</strong>,</p>
                            <p style="margin:0 0 28px;font-size:15px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;">
                                Vous avez demandé à vous connecter à votre compte AgriLink. Utilisez le code ci-dessous pour compléter votre connexion :
                            </p>

                            {# Code block #}
                            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-bottom:28px;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="background-color:#f0fdf4;border:2px dashed #16a34a;border-radius:12px;padding:28px;text-align:center;">
                                        <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#166534;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;">Votre code de vérification</p>
                                        <p style="margin:0;font-size:40px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.35em;color:#166534;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;">{{ code }}</p>
                                        <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" style="margin-top:14px;">
                                            <tr>
                                                <td style="padding-right:6px;vertical-align:middle;">
                                                    <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="#dc2626" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="display:block;">
                                                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
                                                    </svg>
                                                </td>
                                                <td style="font-size:13px;color:#dc2626;font-weight:600;">Ce code expire dans {{ expiration_minutes }} minutes</td>
                                            </tr>
                                        </table>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>

                            {# Security warning #}
                            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="background-color:#fef9c3;border-left:4px solid #eab308;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px 18px;">
                                        <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                                            <tr>
                                                <td style="vertical-align:top;padding-right:10px;padding-top:2px;">
                                                    <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="#92400e" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="display:block;">
                                                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/>
                                                    </svg>
                                                </td>
                                                <td style="color:#78350f;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;">
                                                    <strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:4px;color:#92400e;">Sécurité importante</strong>
                                                    Ne partagez jamais ce code avec qui que ce soit. L'équipe AgriLink ne vous demandera jamais votre code de vérification.
                                                </td>
                                            </tr>
                                        </table>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>

                            {# Not you section #}
                            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="background-color:#fef2f2;border-left:4px solid #ef4444;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px 18px;">
                                        <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                                            <tr>
                                                <td style="vertical-align:top;padding-right:10px;padding-top:2px;">
                                                    <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="#b91c1c" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="display:block;">
                                                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/>
                                                    </svg>
                                                </td>
                                                <td style="color:#7f1d1d;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;">
                                                    <strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:4px;color:#b91c1c;">Vous n'avez pas demandé ce code ?</strong>
                                                    Si vous n'avez pas essayé de vous connecter, quelqu'un tente peut-être d'accéder à votre compte. Nous vous recommandons de changer votre mot de passe immédiatement.
                                                </td>
                                            </tr>
                                        </table>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    {# Footer #}
                    <tr>
                        <td style="background-color:#f9fafb;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:20px 40px;text-align:center;">
                            <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;">Cet email a été envoyé automatiquement par AgriLink.</p>
                            <p style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:11px;color:#d1d5db;">&copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} AgriLink — La plateforme agricole de confiance</p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
